# Internal docs (local reference only) — explicit exceptions for shipped reference docs
# NOTE: must use `docs/*` (glob) not `docs/` (dir) so file-level negations below work.
# Git can't re-include a file once its parent directory is excluded.
docs/*
!docs/PHASE_1_1_MANUAL_GATE.md
!docs/PHASE_1_4_MANUAL_GATE.md
!docs/PHASE_1_5_MANUAL_GATE.md
!docs/PHASE_2_MANUAL_GATE.md
!docs/PHASE_3_MANUAL_GATE.md
